{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgEP3cPFy7QEKtcUtNwqm", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "5 次搜索已经用完，下面根据搜到的结果作答。\n\n**答案：山形县米泽市（遠山地区）。**\n\n依据：农林水产省“うちの郷土料理”把“遠山かぶの粕汁”列为山形县的乡土料理。遠山かぶ的名字来自米泽市遠山地区，是发源于米泽市的山形传统蔬菜。据说上杉家迁到米泽时把它带了过来，1800 年前后上杉鹰山提倡在遠山种植。这种芜菁煮了不容易烂，适合做粕汁这类汤菜。\n\n不过，搜索结果只明确写了芜菁发源于米泽市遠山地区。“粕汁这道菜本身起源于米泽”这句话我没有在原文里看到，是从“发源于米泽的遠山かぶ”和“农水省列为山形县乡土料理”这两点推出来的。\n\n来源：\n- [遠山かぶの粕汁 山形県（農林水産省）](https://www.maff.go.jp/j/keikaku/syokubunka/k_ryouri/search_menu/menu/toyamakabukasujiru_yamagata.html)\n- [遠山かぶ-山形おきたま伝統野菜（おきたま食の応援団）](https://yamagata-okitama-shoku.net/shokuzai.cgi?catid=dentouyasai&shokuzai=touyamakabu)\n- [伝統野菜in山形 遠山かぶ（やさコレ）](https://yasacolle.jp/recipe/traditional-vegetables-yamagata-toyama-kabu)\n- [伝統野菜‐よねざわ体験（米沢伝承館）](http://www.yonezawadenshoukan.jp/booklet2012_food2.html)\n- [遠山かぶ、ごろっと（山形新聞）](https://topics.smt.docomo.ne.jp/article/yamagata/region/yamagata-20251203081834)"}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 1703, "cache_read_input_tokens": 9154, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 1703}, "output_tokens": 8, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T23:46:49.880Z", "request_id": "req_011CgEP3c6tV4XyjxVu8z3Pv"}
